  <article class="tp-article">

  <div class="tp-answer" id="quick-answer"><p><strong>Quick answer:</strong> your walking step length is about <strong>41.5% of your height</strong> for men and 41.3% for women. At 5&nbsp;ft&nbsp;9&nbsp;in, that is about 2&nbsp;ft&nbsp;4&nbsp;in per step, or roughly <strong>2,200 steps per mile</strong>. A stride is two steps.</p></div>

