  <section id="step-vs-stride" aria-labelledby="step-vs-stride-h">
    <h2 id="step-vs-stride-h">Step Length vs. Stride Length</h2>
    <p>A <strong>step</strong> is the distance from one foot to the other; a <strong>stride</strong> is two steps, from one foot back to the same foot. Fitness trackers often say &ldquo;stride length&rdquo; when they mean step length, so check which one a device asks for.</p>
  </section>

